%SIXMD 1
# @?UNIQ - REMOVE ADJACENT DUPLICATE S6REC RECORDS

## DESCRIPTION

COPIES S6REC INPUT WHILE REMOVING ADJACENT DUPLICATE RECORDS.

USAGE IS 'UNIQ'.

THIS COMMAND IS IMPLEMENTED ENTIRELY IN PDP-6 ASSEMBLER AND IS PART OF THE
OPTIONAL ASMUTILS PACKAGE. IT IS INSTALLED IN /OPTION/BASE/EXEC.

## @?FILES

### @?/OPTION/BASE/EXEC/UNIQ
OPTIONAL EXECUTABLE.

### @?/OPTION/BASE/SOURCE/ASMUTILS/UNIQ.S
ASSEMBLER SOURCE.

